{
  "total": 68,
  "totalPage": 2,
  "page": 2,
  "pageSize": 50,
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c4f9",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 785,
      "bookHadithIndex": 51,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Abbas said:\"The houses of the Ansar were far from the mosque and they wanted to move closer. Then the following Verse was revealed: 'We record that which they send before (them), and their traces.'\" [Ya-Sin: 12] He said: So they remained (where they were)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-785-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-785-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-785-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-785-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c4fa",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 786,
      "bookHadithIndex": 52,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'A man's prayer in congregation is twenty-some levels higher than his prayer in his house or in the marketplace",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-786-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-786-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-786-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-786-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c4fb",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 787,
      "bookHadithIndex": 53,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah said: \"The prayer in congregation is twenty-five times more virtuous than the prayer of anyone of you on his own",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-787-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-787-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-787-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-787-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c4fc",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 788,
      "bookHadithIndex": 54,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'the prayer of a man in congregation is twenty-five levels higher than his prayer in his home",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-788-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-788-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-788-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-788-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c4fd",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 789,
      "bookHadithIndex": 55,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'The prayer of a man in congregation is twenty-seven levels more virtuous than a man's prayer on his own",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-789-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-789-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-789-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-789-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c4fe",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 790,
      "bookHadithIndex": 56,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ubayy bin Ka'b said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'The prayer of a man in congregation is higher than his prayer on his own by twenty-four or twenty-five levels",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-790-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-790-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-790-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c4ff",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 791,
      "bookHadithIndex": 57,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'I was thinking of commanding that the call to prayer be given, then I would tell a man to lead the people in prayer, then I would go out with some other men carrying bundles of wood, and go to people who do not attend the prayer, and burn their houses down around them",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-791-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-791-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-791-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-791-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c500",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 792,
      "bookHadithIndex": 58,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn Umm Maktum said:\"I said to the Prophet: 'I am an old man and blind; my house is far away, and I have no one to lead me. Is there any concession (for me not to have to attend the prayer in the mosque)?' He said: 'Can you hear the call?' I said: 'Yes.' He said: 'Then I do not find any concession for you",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-792-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-792-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-792-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-792-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c501",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 793,
      "bookHadithIndex": 59,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn 'Abbas that:The Prophet said: \"Whoever hears the call and does not come, his prayer is not valid, except for those who have an excuse",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-793-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-793-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-793-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c502",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 794,
      "bookHadithIndex": 60,
      "text": "Ibn 'Abbas and Ibn 'Umar narrated that:They heard the Prophet say on his pulpit: \"People should desist from failing to attend the congregations, otherwise Allah will seal their hearts, and they will be among the negligent",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-794-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-794-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-794-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-794-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c503",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 795,
      "bookHadithIndex": 61,
      "text": "It was narrated that Usamah bin Zaid said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Let men desist from failing to attend the congregation, otherwise I will burn their houses down",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-795-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-795-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-795-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c504",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 796,
      "bookHadithIndex": 62,
      "text": "Aishah said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'If the people knew what (reward) there is in the 'Isha' prayer and fajr prayer, they would come even if they had to crawl",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-796-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-796-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-796-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-796-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c505",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 797,
      "bookHadithIndex": 63,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'The most burdensome prayers for the hypocrites are the 'Isha' prayer and the Fajr prayer. If only they knew what (reward) there is in them, they would come to them even if they had to crawl",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-797-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-797-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-797-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-797-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c506",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 798,
      "bookHadithIndex": 64,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Umar bin Khattab that:The Prophet used to say: \"Whoever performs prayer in congregation at the mosque for forty nights, never missing the first Rak'ah of the 'Isha' prayer, Allah will thereby decree for him salvation from the Fire",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-798-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Mawdu"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-798-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-798-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c507",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 799,
      "bookHadithIndex": 65,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'When one of you enters the mosque, he is in a state of prayer, so long as the prayer keeps him there, and the angels will send prayer upon anyone of you so long as he remains in the place where he prayed, saying: \"O Allah, forgive him; O Allah, have mercy on him; O Allah, accept his repentance,\" so long as he does not commit Hadath nor disturb anyone",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-799-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-799-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-799-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-799-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c508",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 800,
      "bookHadithIndex": 66,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Prophet said: \"A muslim does not regularly attend the mosques to perform prayer and remember Allah, but Allah feels happy with him just as the family of one who is absent feels happy when he comes back to them",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-800-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-800-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-800-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-800-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c509",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 801,
      "bookHadithIndex": 67,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Abdullah bin 'Amr said:\"We performed the Maghrib (prayer) with the Messenger of Allah, then those who went back went back, and those who stayed, stayed. Then the Messenger of Allah came back in a hurry, out of breath, with his garment pulled up to his knees, and said: 'Be of good cheer, for your Lord has opened one of the gates of heaven and is boasting of you before the angels, saying: \"Look at My slaves; they have fulfilled one obligatory duty and are awaiting another",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-801-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-801-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-801-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-801-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c81fdd1a4c9c86f0c50a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 4,
      "hadithIndex": 802,
      "bookHadithIndex": 68,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Sa'eed that:The Messenger of Allah said: \"If you see a man frequenting the mosques, then bear witness to his faith. Allah says: 'The mosques of Allah shall be maintained only by those who believe in Allah and the Last Day. [At-Taubah:]",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-802-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-802-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-802-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-4-802-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}